  "statuteText": "485:16-c Adoption of Other Air Pollution Control Measures. –\n\nIn order to reduce air emissions and receive federal credit for such reductions, the commissioner shall be authorized to establish limits on the manufacture, use, or sale of consumer products in accordance with RSA 125-C:6, XVII."
